"entity": {
"name": "Criteo S.A.",
"description": "Criteo SA is a global technology company, which engages in digital performance marketing. The firm enables e-commerce companies to leverage large volumes of granular data to engage and convert their customers. It operates through the Retail Media & Performance Media segments. The Retail Media segment consists of brands, agencies, and retailers for the purchase and sale of retail media, digital advertising inventory, audiences, and services. The Performance Media segment encompasses targeting capabilities and supply and AdTech services. The company was founded by Jean-Baptiste Rudelle, Franck Le Ouay, Pascal Gauthier, Laurent Quatrefages, and Romain Niccoli on November 3, 2005 and is headquartered in Luxembourg.",
